// Input: every key is an Action with a Binding. The held actions (walking, running, mining) are
// read by the oreelse systems through the OreActions singleton; the actions that fire once are
// awaited by the loops below, each calling the oreelse function behind it. The key that starts
// the game on the title screen is any key (OreTitleStart reads the keys).
